    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/4253ab6a723fc2d38b4e66db689378be.webp?t=1754363705\" /></div><br>Discover a procedurally generated post-apocalyptic world. Each new game offers a different starting point and experience, allowing you to collect resources and survive in abandoned locations and roads.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/9bab6a31cdcffa3331c65493a92beb41.poster.avif?t=1754363705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/9bab6a31cdcffa3331c65493a92beb41.webm?t=1754363705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/9bab6a31cdcffa3331c65493a92beb41.mp4?t=1754363705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/83f3beff4c8fbebb2a6d7ca8739d79c3.webp?t=1754363705\" /></div><br>Begin your journey with a rundown rv, repairing and upgrading each part. Personalize everything from stoves and refrigerators to toilets and seating areas, creating your own living space.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/05e731d3b9af6fd06ff762f7fb0b7eb9.poster.avif?t=1754363705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/05e731d3b9af6fd06ff762f7fb0b7eb9.webm?t=1754363705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/05e731d3b9af6fd06ff762f7fb0b7eb9.mp4?t=1754363705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/4b9f46e60ea0bd08fb154fc63aa192f9.webp?t=1754363705\" /></div><br>Stay alive with activities such as cooking, fishing, repairing, and making coffee. Use your rv's kitchen to cook the food you find, making more effective meals.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/f96c954b894519e3c86651f684fe2f69.poster.avif?t=1754363705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/f96c954b894519e3c86651f684fe2f69.webm?t=1754363705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/f96c954b894519e3c86651f684fe2f69.mp4?t=1754363705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/fdd7ca694a30a55a0d09b4f314d5d86f.webp?t=1754363705\" /></div><br>Discover Nomad Drive, where every part is fully interactable. Touch, customize, and explore everything from furniture to appliances. Make the RV truly yours!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/dd362be763e4168c07473ee69e7a0096.poster.avif?t=1754363705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/dd362be763e4168c07473ee69e7a0096.webm?t=1754363705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/dd362be763e4168c07473ee69e7a0096.mp4?t=1754363705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/dfde543911a2040050a4bd3799aab370.webp?t=1754363705\" /></div><br>Manage energy using solar panels or fuel-powered generators. Utilize various energy sources to meet your RV's needs and extend your survival time.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/eb243b4bb7c8c4df690b21b792a0b7c0.poster.avif?t=1754363705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/eb243b4bb7c8c4df690b21b792a0b7c0.webm?t=1754363705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/eb243b4bb7c8c4df690b21b792a0b7c0.mp4?t=1754363705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/e7d7aee2553e8e13cd2dbf25875d5d24.webp?t=1754363705\" /></div>",
